 <gi><title>Statistics</title>
      <p> Statistics is the science of gaining insight, drawing conclusions, and making decisions from data, 
          which also invovles the collection, organization, analysis, interpretation, and presentation of data.
      </p>
 </gi>

  <gi><title>Data</title>
      <p> Data is a collection of facts, or information, brought together for reference or analysis and comes in a multitude of formats, 
          including numbers, words, measurements, observations, blocks of text, and images.
      </p>
  </gi> 


</glossary>
